# Installed locally when running olma2's tests off-server; the server installs
# its own from package-lock.json during deploy. @resvg/resvg-js pulls a
# platform-specific native binary, so a committed tree would be wrong for the
# droplet anyway.
#
# No trailing slash, deliberately. `node_modules/` matches a DIRECTORY only, so
# it never matched the SYMLINK an npm install in a sibling worktree left behind
# — and on 2026-09-23 a `git add` of that symlink was accepted into a merge
# commit, pinning one laptop's absolute path into main as a 120000 blob. Git
# does not follow a symlink when matching an ignore rule, so the shape that
# slipped through is exactly the one the slash excluded. Without it, both match.
node_modules

# Local env / secrets — the real ones live in /opt/olma2/.env (0600) on the box.
.env
